{
  "source": "Prompts/probability-and-prediction-v10.mp4",
  "duration": 144.768,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 6.54,
      "text": "When you type a prompt into chatGPT and receive a coherent response, it can feel like the system is thinking."
    },
    {
      "start": 7.22,
      "end": 13.38,
      "text": "These systems function by calculating probability, analyzing the statistical likelihood of what should happen next."
    },
    {
      "start": 14.26,
      "end": 19.58,
      "text": "This process of predicting outcomes based on specific data traces back to 1654,"
    },
    {
      "start": 20.14,
      "end": 25.6,
      "text": "when mathematicians Blaze Pascal and Pierre de Fermat exchanged letters about the odds in gambling."
    },
    {
      "start": 25.6,
      "end": 30.42,
      "text": "Their work provided the foundation for how we calculate the chance of a future event,"
    },
    {
      "start": 31.08,
      "end": 34.48,
      "text": "a framework that remains central to how modern AI builds an answer."
    },
    {
      "start": 36.32,
      "end": 39.08,
      "text": "To see how that works, we start with standard probability."
    },
    {
      "start": 40.0,
      "end": 43.52,
      "text": "This applies to scenarios where every possible outcome is equally likely."
    },
    {
      "start": 44.26,
      "end": 45.32,
      "text": "The math is a simple division."
    },
    {
      "start": 46.12,
      "end": 51.24,
      "text": "You count the ways to get the specific result you want and divide that by the total number of possible outcomes."
    },
    {
      "start": 52.52,
      "end": 54.08,
      "text": "Consider a basic scenario."
    },
    {
      "start": 54.74,
      "end": 55.68,
      "text": "You toss two coins."
    },
    {
      "start": 56.44,
      "end": 59.82,
      "text": "To find the chance both land on heads, we map out the possibilities."
    },
    {
      "start": 60.8,
      "end": 62.78,
      "text": "There are four equally likely results."
    },
    {
      "start": 63.78,
      "end": 65.08,
      "text": "Only one matches our goal."
    },
    {
      "start": 65.7,
      "end": 71.82,
      "text": "We divide that successful path by the four total outcomes, giving a probability of 25%."
    },
    {
      "start": 71.82,
      "end": 74.4,
      "text": "However, odds are rarely static."
    },
    {
      "start": 75.1,
      "end": 80.02,
      "text": "In mathematics, conditional probability describes how new evidence changes the calculation."
    },
    {
      "start": 80.02,
      "end": 84.18,
      "text": "Imagine we run the toss again, but this time someone peeks."
    },
    {
      "start": 84.68,
      "end": 86.82,
      "text": "They tell you the first coin landed on heads."
    },
    {
      "start": 87.54,
      "end": 92.84,
      "text": "Because the first coin is heads, we can immediately eliminate any outcome starting with tails."
    },
    {
      "start": 93.54,
      "end": 95.16,
      "text": "Those possibilities are ruled out."
    },
    {
      "start": 95.88,
      "end": 98.88,
      "text": "Our total pool of outcomes has shrunk from four to two."
    },
    {
      "start": 99.42,
      "end": 103.42,
      "text": "Out of those two remaining paths, only one results in double heads."
    },
    {
      "start": 104.2,
      "end": 107.82,
      "text": "One divided by two means the probability jumps to 50%."
    },
    {
      "start": 107.82,
      "end": 112.28,
      "text": "The physical state of the coins didn't change, but your knowledge of them did."
    },
    {
      "start": 113.02,
      "end": 115.4,
      "text": "If you ask, what should I name my new dog?"
    },
    {
      "start": 116.0,
      "end": 119.04,
      "text": "And the AI begins its response with, you could name him."
    },
    {
      "start": 119.62,
      "end": 121.94,
      "text": "Those words become the context for the next calculation."
    },
    {
      "start": 122.96,
      "end": 125.38,
      "text": "It might find a 22% chance for spot."
    },
    {
      "start": 126.12,
      "end": 128.62,
      "text": "Once a word is chosen, it is added to the text."
    },
    {
      "start": 129.42,
      "end": 135.04,
      "text": "This updated string of words becomes the new evidence for the next calculation, and the cycle repeats instantly."
    },
    {
      "start": 136.2,
      "end": 140.88,
      "text": "AI builds answers with probabilities, one prediction at a time."
    }
  ],
